# Service Container

The {{ dg.containerName }} bundles the discrete services a plugin needs. A plugin reaches into the container to get the current connection, host/topology info, shared caches, background monitors, and events — instead of doing that work itself. Shared services are reused across connections; the rest are per-connection.

