The {{ dg.productName }} groups its internal capabilities into a **service container** — a bundle of discrete services that plugins reach into instead of doing the work themselves. It includes a plugin manager that drives the [pipelines](./pipelines), a service that tracks the current connection and host list, a storage service for shared caches, a monitor service for background monitors, and an event publisher.

